      <div type="clause" n="18 18.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 18 18.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Hit is earfoðe eall to gesecganne þæt se beðen|can sceal ðe scire healt . ne sceolde he nan ðing . Forgyman ðe æfre to note meh|te . ne forða musfellan. ne þæt git læsse is to hæpsan pinn .</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">It is difficult to say everything that one who runs a shire must keep in mind; [but] he should not overlook anything which might ever be of significance, not even a mousetrap even though it be as insignificant as a fastening peg</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[18] Hit is earfoðe eall to gesecganne, þæt se beðencan sceal, ðe scire healt. [18.1] Ne sceolde he nan ðing forgyman, ðe æfre to note mehte: ne forða musfellan ne, þæt git læsse is, to hæpsan pinn.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
